flowchart TD
  Q[Incoming user turn] --> I{Intent family?}
  I -->|Social| A[Short human reply; no commitment]
  I -->|Simple answer| B[Direct answer with sourced context if needed]
  I -->|Existing work| C[Resolve authorized commitment reference]
  I -->|New work| D[Create durable commitment]
  I -->|External action| P[Authorization and approval]
  C --> D2[Merge new constraint into same goal revision]
  D --> E[Start safe read-only discovery]
  D2 --> E
  E --> F{Missing decisive information?}
  F -->|No| G[Execute under controller]
  F -->|Yes| H[Ask focused question; continue safe work]
  H --> G
  G --> J{Evidence sufficient?}
  J -->|No| K[Bounded deeper investigation / partial]
  J -->|Yes| L[Prepare recipient-specific delivery]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Outbox + confirmation]
